            "mathilde",
            "loisel"
          ],
          "perceived_by": [
            {
              "character": "loisel",
              "mode": "witnessed",
              "content": "She will not go, since she has no dress."
            }
          ],
          "location": "loisel-flat"
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "round": 3,
          "text": "Loisel asked what a suitable dress would cost; Mathilde, calculating what she could ask without a refusal, said about four hundred francs; he grew pale, since it was the sum he was saving for a gun, but agreed.",
          "importance": 4,
          "tags": [
