              "mode": "witnessed"
            }
          ],
          "location": "streets"
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "round": 3,
          "text": "Before the glass Mathilde removed her wraps to see herself once more in her glory and found the necklace gone from her neck; she told Loisel she had lost it, and they searched her dress, cloak and pockets in vain.",
          "importance": 5,
          "tags": [
            "necklace",
            "loss",
            "search"
